One note:
If defined CONFIG_PRINTK_SYNC=y then prink internally  use k_spin_lock and printing all message without interrupts. 
It seems to me that this tests must be use this config define, because uart_nrfx_uart.c  use  **k_msleep(1);** too, so task switched too.

```
void vprintk(const char *fmt, va_list ap)
{
	struct out_context ctx = { 0 };
#ifdef CONFIG_PRINTK_SYNC
	k_spinlock_key_t key = k_spin_lock(&lock);
#endif

	cbvprintf(char_out, &ctx, fmt, ap);

#ifdef CONFIG_PRINTK_SYNC
	k_spin_unlock(&lock, key);
#endif
}
```

